OL,3,AParis police seize gas masks and
OL,4,Aweapons as mass protests planned across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Paris have seized weapons and
OL,8,Fgas masks in a crackdown ahead of
OL,9,Fexpected mass protests across France
OL,11,FShopfronts are boarded up, some tourist
OL,12,Fspots are shut and the capital has
OL,13,Fclosed a number of metro stations - and
OL,14,FPlace de la Bastille has been evacuated
OL,16,FIt follows last weekend's riots and
OL,17,Flooting that impacted thousands of
OL,18,Fbusinesses and saw more than 2,700
OL,19,Farrested
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
