OL,3,AParis police seize gas masks and
OL,4,Aweapons as mass protests planned across
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FCurfews, closures and protest bans are
OL,8,Fin place in cities including Paris,
OL,9,FMarseille and Lyon - although some
OL,10,Fdemonstrations are being allowed
OL,12,FTrade unions and the yellow vest
OL,13,Fmovement say protests will go ahead in
OL,14,Fhundreds of locations across the
OL,15,Fcountry
